Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.24,0:00:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.00,0:01:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.02,0:01:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.06,0:01:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,When your body will disappear,\NI will not be able to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.14,0:01:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell no, I will not be able to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.74,0:01:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But you had to throw the scout boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.58,0:01:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Down for the count little bomber just\Nneutralized the guy hiding on the cliff good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.64,0:01:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go find out who it\Nwas hold it a buck yo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.76,0:02:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This beach could be crawling\Nwith pursuers eager to end us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.02,0:02:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here for one reason only\Nit's imperative We begin a replay
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.76,0:02:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,of the man who photographed\NTrish's mother here 15 years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.44,0:02:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The longer we stay, the greater\Nrisk we're bound to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.76,0:02:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but there was only\None guy hiding on the cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.70,0:02:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ucharate, don't you remember the stand\Nwe both encountered when on the plane?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.48,0:02:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista turned the user into a bullet-ridden\Nheap for all the good it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.64,0:02:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to figure out\Nwho the hell that is,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.90,0:02:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,or we're just asking for\Ntrouble to follow us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.30,0:02:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia, can you confirm his death?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.98,0:02:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.60,0:02:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But his breathing's getting\Nfainter and fainter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.06,0:02:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He hasn't moved at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.02,0:02:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.93,0:02:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia and I will go investigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.66,0:02:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Abakio, start using Moody Jazz\Npronto and begin a replay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.94,0:02:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.76,0:02:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Just bear in mind we can't linger here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.56,0:02:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,How much time do you think you'll require?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.12,0:02:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,For nearly two decades?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.94,0:02:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Eight to ten minutes if I'm being hopeful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.56,0:03:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll get it done in five.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.44,0:03:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Meaning lookouts are necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.98,0:03:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, Trish, and Mista are needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.84,0:03:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The very second Moody Jazz reveals the\Nboss's true identity, we get the hell out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.66,0:03:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia, use Lil' Bomber.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.46,0:03:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the others know we need them out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.44,0:03:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.44,0:03:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, I've solved the mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.72,0:03:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.70,0:03:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Your true self.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.04,0:03:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I expire, let me see it. Your
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.28,0:03:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,real face apologies but i cannot
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.40,0:03:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,allow this conversation to continue\Nrisotto nero bujarati and his crew
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.10,0:03:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,cannot be allowed to know about me\Ntake pride in yourself though you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.74,0:03:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,were a true warrior and led the hitman\Nteam well You shall die with honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.38,0:04:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Your team will say the same\Nwhen you meet in the afterlife.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.12,0:04:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life will come to an end soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.12,0:04:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But Bucciarati is also here\Nand is on his way to find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.94,0:04:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So before you slip away, return the\Niron nutrients you ripped from my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.60,0:04:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,In exchange, I shall take it\Nupon myself to lay you to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.88,0:04:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to avoid the\Nembarrassment of a slow, painful death,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.62,0:04:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,especially at the hands\Nof Bucciarati's crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.04,0:04:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The very murderers who took the\Nlives of your dear teammates.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.04,0:04:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Such abject weakness would only bring shame\Nto them as they rest in the beyond. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.26,0:04:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,won't... die...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.94,0:04:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you muttering?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.74,0:04:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to speak up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.44,0:04:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,All I want from you is\Nmy iron risotto, Nero.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.06,0:04:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you that I'm not dying alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.06,0:04:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Isstan may inflate my\Nflesh, but it all works out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.12,0:04:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Because those chunks, the ones with my\Nessence that are scattered everywhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.14,0:04:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,will let me use them to drag you to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.90,0:05:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now fire, Lil' Bomber. Die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.88,0:05:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.04,0:05:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with Lil' Bomber?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.08,0:05:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.12,0:05:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The stronzo stuck himself to my stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.42,0:05:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Emperor Crimson.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.54,0:05:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I've only obliterated time by\Nhalf a second. Everything that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.74,0:05:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,occurred during that time has\Nbeen removed leaving behind
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.80,0:05:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the result of the remaining\Nhalf second and to spare you the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.02,0:05:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,suspense that'd be the bullets\Nripping through your flesh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.82,0:05:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Bravissimo risotto\Nnero. You embrace death.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.76,0:05:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,honorably yet even with\Nyou out of the picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.02,0:05:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,My circumstances remain far from ideal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.78,0:05:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.42,0:05:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.18,0:05:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure, Narancia? Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.94,0:06:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Something burrowed into Lil' Bomber.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.86,0:06:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.24,0:06:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So they've come.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.86,0:06:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,At last.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.92,0:06:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to get out of sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.92,0:06:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hide for now and\Nreplenish my stolen nutrients.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.20,0:06:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hold here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.08,0:06:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We must tread carefully now. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.82,0:06:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.56,0:06:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no question his breathing\Nstopped, and his stand is gone too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.36,0:06:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's deader than dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.18,0:06:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna be tough to ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.12,0:06:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I overdid it and mauled the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.30,0:06:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's safe to say he's\Nthe head of the Hitman team.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.40,0:06:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.60,0:06:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He came here solo, so he was\Neither an elite assassin,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.80,0:06:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,or regardless of personal skill,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.26,0:06:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,the sole survivor of a decimated squadron.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.38,0:06:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only that, there was\Nanother competent killer here,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.10,0:06:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,one who got in his way and ended his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.78,0:06:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, not to question your sleuthing skills,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.06,0:07:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,but I was the one who littered\Nhis corpse with those holes,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.98,0:07:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.89,0:07:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, you were merely a pawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.28,0:07:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not alone on this battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.68,0:07:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.59,0:07:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at his foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.10,0:07:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Little bomber would have\Ninflicted severe burns,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.70,0:07:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,but that wound shows no\Nsign of any such injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.80,0:07:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,meaning the limb was torn from his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.48,0:07:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.68,0:07:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Lil' Bomber only picked up one\Nliving body on its scanner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.80,0:07:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still not getting another signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.96,0:07:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides, why would anyone do\Nsomething so foul in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.02,0:07:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it stands to reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.14,0:07:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Both combatants were blindsided, so the\Nsurvivor is out there licking their wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.82,0:07:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Though how they're concealing their\Nbreathing is still a mystery to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.82,0:07:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia, have you already\Nalerted Giorno and the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.44,0:07:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they're heading to the\Nplace the picture came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.80,0:07:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll follow after them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.68,0:07:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,From here on, we're tracking\Nanything that draws breath,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.70,0:07:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,even if it's as small as a mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.66,0:07:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Our mystery killer is still in the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.94,0:07:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They're an extremely dangerous\Nmember of the Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.20,0:07:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.52,0:08:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is inconceivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.08,0:08:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sardinia's my birthplace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.84,0:08:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't see it sullied by that scum.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.38,0:08:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we're outdoors, but this is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.16,0:08:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If I up the sensitivity so that\Nit picks up frogs and rodents,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.66,0:08:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have no accuracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.32,0:08:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.56,0:08:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,if I mess with the range too much,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.38,0:08:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,the radar is going to start registering\Nrandom tourists and car exhaust.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.10,0:08:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.01,0:08:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just shoot down\Neverything in the area!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.82,0:08:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.73,0:08:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The frogs and mice will no doubt be\Nhiding in the shadows and burrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.40,0:08:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Their skittish movements\Nwill be totally different.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.88,0:08:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Set your sights on someone\Nclearly on the run. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.14,0:08:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, they'll be trying\Nto leave the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.14,0:08:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No time to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.68,0:08:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.40,0:09:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakio can't use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.78,0:09:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,is a cursed stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.56,0:09:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There, dead ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.10,0:09:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are Narancia and Bucciarati?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.32,0:09:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Could be wrong here,\Nbut I only see Abacchio.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.06,0:09:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There must have been an enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.84,0:09:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They're likely in pursuit now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.36,0:09:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and it seems Abacchio still\Nhasn't gotten his replay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.06,0:09:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,to the time period that we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.42,0:09:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish knows the photograph was\Ntaken 15 years ago in June,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.06,0:09:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,but she has no recollection of\Nthe specific date in question.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.90,0:09:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Moody Jazz is using its timer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.52,0:09:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,To pinpoint the exact time when\Nit obtains that information.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.64,0:09:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,it'll take the form of the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.82,0:09:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.18,0:09:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's play over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.84,0:09:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the goalie today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.42,0:09:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.64,0:09:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock paper scissors. Then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.40,0:09:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then have you found them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.28,0:10:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Got him, Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.92,0:10:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.94,0:10:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm picking up a signal 80\Nmeters to our right, down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.52,0:10:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They're moving slow, but they're making\Ntheir way straight for the tourists!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.74,0:10:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia, I need you to hold back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.04,0:10:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever the enemy is,\Nwe need intel on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.16,0:10:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He completely stopped moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.48,0:10:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.54,0:10:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.06,0:10:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, you have a choice to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.30,0:10:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But just know I'm prepared to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.14,0:10:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're no longer capable of combat,\NI command you to show yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.98,0:10:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my word, you'll live.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.08,0:10:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm giving you three seconds. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.96,0:11:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Your time's up and your life is forfeit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.04,0:11:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Superman!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.32,0:11:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.74,0:11:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.98,0:11:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault that you suck! Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.94,0:11:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Just get the ball and move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.34,0:11:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.22,0:11:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already the 25th.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.20,0:11:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,June's almost over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.94,0:11:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.44,0:11:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it better be the right\Ndamn June 15 years back?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.36,0:11:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Higher! Higher!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.46,0:11:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw some rocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.62,0:11:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Shake the branches or climb up higher!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.22,0:11:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you brats shut the hell up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.50,0:11:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Play your stupid little\Ngame somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.62,0:11:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost done, geezer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.68,0:11:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Who even kicked it up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.58,0:11:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you quit it with the rocks already?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.78,0:11:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna have to reach harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.10,0:11:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.66,0:11:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is as far as I can reach!\NEnough. Just move it. I'll do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.30,0:11:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.10,0:11:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this? Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.88,0:12:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't attack him, Narancia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.68,0:12:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just an ordinary kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.68,0:12:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the tourists.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.32,0:12:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,His mouth is sewn shut!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.04,0:12:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And with his shoelaces!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.76,0:12:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This has to be the work\Nof the enemy stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.40,0:12:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They must have switched places.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.44,0:12:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The boy's complexion tells me whoever\Nit is has lost a lot of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.18,0:12:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Question is where did all the blood go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.64,0:12:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did this child\Nabusing monster run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.34,0:12:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd they vanish into thin air?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.16,0:12:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They were practically dead seconds ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.28,0:12:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.40,0:12:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,None of this makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.72,0:12:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.34,0:12:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.48,0:12:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Gracias, señor! Gracias, señora!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.78,0:12:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.96,0:12:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.87,0:12:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your help and everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.30,0:12:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.62,0:12:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's just no place like home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.00,0:13:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on a roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.72,0:13:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.66,0:13:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We get right this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.90,0:13:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, there was Norfolk!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.84,0:13:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What was your name again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.22,0:13:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Fates Countdown!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.36,0:13:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,uh do you need some\Nhelp down there officer
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.12,0:13:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,sorry to interrupt you i'm\Nhere on an assignment looking
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.32,0:13:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,for fingerprints there was a\Nrobbery across the street last
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.20,0:13:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,night poor Fool got struck\Nwith a bottle and the pieces
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.48,0:13:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,went flying everywhere some even\Nwent clear past the sidewalk
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.20,0:14:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,including the piece he was holding\Nappears the suspect through something
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.30,0:14:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,over here and I think it landed in\Nthis bin I'm sure I'll find a set
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.44,0:14:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,of prints here so that's the part\NI'm on the hunt for so you're really
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.94,0:14:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,gonna look through them all it comes\Nwith the job I see guess you're right
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.28,0:14:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh say uh gone. Well,\Njust so I know for my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.98,0:14:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,information don't take\Nthis the wrong way i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.92,0:14:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,just curious but what\Nwill you do if you don't
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.34,0:14:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,find any prints it's very\Nlikely that you won't
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.52,0:14:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,we're still what do you\Ndo if you do find him
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.56,0:14:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and the bastard just\Ngets some dirty lawyer
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.46,0:14:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,who still gets him off\Nscot-free what's your
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.94,0:14:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,next move i mean how do\Nyou keep going after that
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.28,0:14:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,good questions i keep going because\Ni have a greater end goal if the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.64,0:15:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,outcome is your focus then it's easy\Nto look for shortcuts and ultimately
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.36,0:15:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,shortcuts keep you from seeing the\Ntruth it drains your spark for life
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.68,0:15:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,what matters most is your will to\Nseek the truth despite the outcome
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.84,0:15:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you keep that in mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.92,0:15:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,it doesn't matter if he\Ngets away on this Grand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.92,0:15:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Justice always has its day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.12,0:15:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's what we're\Nreally fighting for, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.28,0:15:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I envy your will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.58,0:15:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,For as long as I can remember,\NI wanted to be a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.48,0:15:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Even as a kid, I dreamed of becoming\Nthe most respectable officer I could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.42,0:15:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then, I also had the\Nkind of will you possess now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.84,0:15:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I screwed up big time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.16,0:15:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a word for folks like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.14,0:15:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We're utterly hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.00,0:15:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We never see things through to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.16,0:15:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And our shortcomings\Nalways lead to failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.34,0:15:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't be more wrong, Abbacchio.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.92,0:15:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The path you're on is righteous and just.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.88,0:16:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Our will is the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.72,0:16:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That will you possessed when you were\Nonly a fledgling police officer remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.94,0:16:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It still burns inside you as brightly\Nand dutifully as ever, Abbacchio.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.18,0:16:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But how…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.38,0:16:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,how could you possibly know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.32,0:16:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on just a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.16,0:16:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I have this feeling we've\Nmet before, but where?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.88,0:16:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going, Abbacchio?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.14,0:16:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting on that bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.48,0:16:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all coming back to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.28,0:16:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.62,0:16:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.98,0:16:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to help my comrades\Nwith what's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.64,0:16:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten, Abakyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.52,0:16:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You came here on that bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.34,0:16:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a last stop, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.56,0:16:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no going back. Not ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.30,0:16:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait. It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.44,0:16:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,All along, it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.72,0:16:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I took that damn bribe\Nand you paid the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.44,0:17:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Abbacchio, you've done\Nso much good since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.46,0:17:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear me when I say, I am\Nso proud of you, amiko mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.22,0:17:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh god, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.94,0:17:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not real!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.50,0:17:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.58,0:17:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.02,0:17:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to heal him, Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.76,0:17:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for? Fix this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.86,0:17:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something before I kick your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.54,0:17:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but it was an\Ninstant kill at close range.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.72,0:17:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We just didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.06,0:17:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,we didn't make it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.00,0:17:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you do it, Ipaccio?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.64,0:17:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you let the enemy\Nget close enough to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.28,0:17:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, make sure Trish\Nstays in the turtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.74,0:18:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's highly likely our foe's next\Nmove will be to come after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.68,0:18:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.20,0:18:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not safe for us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.10,0:18:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This tragedy's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.94,0:18:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We're getting out of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.72,0:18:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Our investigation has ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.62,0:18:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to\Nsay here, Bucciarati?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.94,0:18:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Abacchio's gonna wake up any second!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.90,0:18:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.96,0:18:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll take time, but he's coming back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.26,0:18:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Give him a chance to wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.20,0:18:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him I'm right, Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.98,0:18:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that what happened before?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.92,0:18:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.83,0:18:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That is enough, Narancia!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.10,0:18:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to leave this instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.00,0:18:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring out Little Bomber and\Nstart scouting an escape route.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.62,0:18:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you saying, Bucciarati?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.78,0:18:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not making any sense right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.34,0:18:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They want to face the bastards\Nso I can blow their ass to bits!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.68,0:18:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If they're nearby, then they\Nneed to come out and face me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.44,0:18:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Mista?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.42,0:18:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.42,0:18:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, answer me, Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.94,0:18:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia, we have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.34,0:18:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.86,0:18:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.90,0:19:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.66,0:19:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you being this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.36,0:19:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You've never been the guy to\Nturn your back on a comrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.22,0:19:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You bring him back to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.84,0:19:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Do your friggin' job and start\Ngrowing some replacements.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.12,0:19:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.42,0:19:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia! I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.50,0:19:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.34,0:19:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're just leaving\Nhim here to run, Pucinati?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.18,0:19:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,After everything our group has been\Nthrough, how can you just walk away?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.34,0:19:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ask me to abandon him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.30,0:19:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything but that, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.78,0:19:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That is a direct order, Narancia.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.54,0:19:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Abakio was aware of the\Nrisk and did his duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.76,0:19:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.06,0:19:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, please, but you're at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.26,0:20:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.78,0:20:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati, don't go yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.98,0:20:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever this is, it must mean something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.64,0:20:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It has to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.90,0:20:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but what's he holding?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.78,0:20:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.18,0:20:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, it looks like a normal rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.34,0:20:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.90,0:20:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Restore it, Golden Wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.48,0:20:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Return from whence you came.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.40,0:20:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.40,0:20:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Abbacchio actually\Nmanaged to complete his replay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.36,0:21:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be a death mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.86,0:21:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The replay created it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.14,0:21:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Before Moody Jazz vanished, he succeeded.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.22,0:21:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He used the last of his stand\Nenergy and imprinted this face here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.40,0:21:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This pillar is like a lithograph.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.06,0:21:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Abakio, left behind the\Nmessage of a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.66,0:21:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the visage of the boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.78,0:21:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Abakio, you've made everyone proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.10,0:21:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly, your unrelenting\Ndetermination to uncover the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.02,0:21:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,has made its way to the hearts\Nand minds of your comrades.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.34,0:21:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And that, my old friend,\Nis all that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.28,0:22:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up, join us Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.40,0:22:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Just say this a lie. We are the power,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.56,0:22:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Those days are future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.08,0:22:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we are the fighters,\Njust fighting for a right
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.92,0:23:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.28,0:24:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
